flowchart TD
  Arrival[Actual worker arrival / four opening workers] --> Staffing[Rear exclusive staffing allocation]
  Explicit[Explicit facility / crew / qualified commitments] --> Staffing
  Starter[Existing once-only workplace starter requests] -->|eligible default labour at safe boundary| Staffing
  Staffing -->|remaining eligible workers| Hauling[Default Hauling pool]
  UI[Workers / Jobs: expand Hauling] --> Draft[Native grip drag or Move up/down: local draft]
  Draft --> Confirm[Confirm complete category order]
  Confirm --> Policy[Scene-owned HaulingPolicy]
  Policy -->|existing settle at idle boundary| Next[Highest-priority feasible task]
  Hauling --> Next
  Next --> Receiving[Receiving: finite slots / claims / walk / pickup / carry / deposit]
  Next --> Dispatch[Dispatch: ordinary manifest staging/loading / actual truck]
  Next --> Haul[Existing construction / production / other haul jobs]
  Receiving --> Safe[Finish active safe work / apply pending handoff]
  Dispatch --> Safe
  Haul --> Safe
  Safe --> Staffing
  Receiving --> Facts[Actual owner events / supplied status]
  Dispatch --> Facts
  Haul --> Facts
  Facts -->|no draft overwrite or per-frame eligibility scan| UI
